5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright everyone, let's be smart about this. We need to find the werewolf fast, so the Seer should probably be careful about when to reveal themselves.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree. A premature reveal makes the Seer an immediate target for the wolf. Observation is our best tool for now.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll trust you all! Let's just be honest and kind to each other so we can solve this together.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Being too open might be dangerous. The werewolf will just blend in. We should look for inconsistencies in how people speak.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'll follow Takumi! He sounds like he knows what he's doing. Let's just do whatever the strongest plan is!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Thanks, Rin. I think we should spend today just getting a feel for everyone. If anyone acts weird tomorrow, we call them out.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,That is a sound approach. We should monitor who tries to steer the conversation too aggressively or who stays too quiet.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,That sounds fair! I'll just be myself. I hope we can all survive the night!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, you're very optimistic. But remember, the person acting the nicest is sometimes the one hiding something.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Whoa, Misaki is scary! But she's probably right. I'll keep my eyes wide open!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Let's not start accusing people before the game even really starts. We just need a baseline of behavior.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,Precisely. Let us simply observe. I have no further points to add for now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I didn't mean anything bad! I just want us to be a team.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not accusing, just analyzing. It's the only way to win.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for the adventure! Let's see what happens tomorrow!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
