31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up. I'm the Seer, and I checked Yumi. She's the werewolf. We need to vote her out right now.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"That was a very fast reveal, Takumi. Are you certain? Or are you trying to rush us into a mistake?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"What?! Takumi, why would you say that? I've been nothing but nice! You're making a huge mistake!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"It is a bit sudden. @Takumi, why reveal yourself so early? It seems reckless, even if you are the Seer.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Takumi said it, so it must be true! Yumi, how could you do this to us?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I revealed myself because I found the wolf on night zero. There's no point in waiting and letting her kill more people.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"If Takumi is lying, he's a very bold werewolf. But if he's the Seer, the game ends today. The logic is simple.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,Please believe me! I'm just a villager! Takumi is just trying to frame me for some reason!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,It's possible Takumi is the Possessed trying to protect the real wolf by sacrificing a villager to gain trust.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Takumi is brave! He wouldn't lie about being the Seer just to trick us!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, stop trying to confuse everyone. I have the result. Yumi is the wolf. Period.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"@Misaki's theory is a possibility, but Takumi's confidence is consistent with his personality. Yumi's reaction is purely emotional.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm emotional because I'm innocent! George, you're usually so fair, please don't listen to him!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm just thinking out loud. However, if the majority believes Takumi, I won't stand in the way.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for Yumi! We can't let the wolf stay!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Let's vote. Yumi is the target.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,I've seen enough. The evidence of the Seer's claim outweighs the emotional plea.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,This is so unfair! You're all wrong!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Very well. Let's proceed to the vote.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Bye-bye, wolfy!","{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
